"text": "Milwaukee Bucks owner Jimmy Haslem also."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:k232bvyupkpxxtichw6i2uww/app.bsky.feed.post/3myhmpwcpok2o", "author_did": "did:plc:k232bvyupkpxxtichw6i2uww", "handle": "kurly99.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-22T12:04:51.511Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T12:04:51.744Z", "text": "The Packers are a despicable organization.  No two ways around it.  I\u2019m trying to imagine the outrage if Jacobs was a Milwaukee Bucks player."}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-22T13:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-22T14:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:anyr5atp5hwuwhwiwkz7oxfr/app.bsky.feed.post/3myhwe3bwe22l", "author_did": "did:plc:anyr5atp5hwuwhwiwkz7oxfr", "handle": "journalistct.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-22T14:57:11.497Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T14:57:12.046Z", "text": "It\u2019s a new day in DC for hoops fans. From ESPN: After beating the Milwaukee Bucks in their season opener, Washington Wizards \u201chave a winning record for the first time in 1,423 days.\u201d  And we haven\u2019t seen AJ yet\u2026"}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-22T15:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:aes2ebgyxmheiji6znehsndz/app.bsky.feed.post/3myhzhqxot527", "author_did": "did:plc:aes2ebgyxmheiji6znehsndz", "handle": "celticsbriefly.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-22T15:52:56.039Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T15:52:57.742Z", "text": "Wizards fans created a hostile, high-energy home atmosphere that helped Washington defeat the Milwaukee Bucks and energized Anthony Davis\u2019 debut.\n"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:cgmqlmqekfjeqdxsfzppgp76/app.bsky.feed.post/3myhzewnz2s2g", "author_did": "did:plc:cgmqlmqekfjeqdxsfzppgp76", "handle": "gswbriefly.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-22T15:51:21.347Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T15:51:23.242Z", "text": "Wizards fans created a hostile, high-energy home atmosphere that helped Washington defeat the Milwaukee Bucks and energized Anthony Davis\u2019 debut.\n"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:i2jc6ogikn53jkny6y4ii2xd/app.bsky.feed.post/3myhykhbkic2a", "author_did": "did:plc:i2jc6ogikn53jkny6y4ii2xd", "handle": "raymondnorman.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-22T15:36:32.877Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T15:36:33.251Z", "text": "How did Giannis do in debut for Heat?\n\nFor the first time in his NBA career, Giannis Antetokounmpo played a game not in a Milwaukee Bucks uniform. How did he do?\n\nwww.jsonline.com/story/sports..."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:3idbjko4m6rewnnwhxrkfldy/app.bsky.feed.post/3myhwjyq43b2t", "author_did": "did:plc:3idbjko4m6rewnnwhxrkfldy", "handle": "washsunmetro.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-22T15:00:30.017638494Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T15:00:31.041Z", "text": "For sheer visceral impact, what stands out most from Washington\u2019s 128-116 win over the Milwaukee Bucks is something that can\u2019t readily be measured: the sheer alpha-maleness on display on Capital One Arena."}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-22T16:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:wgqjs6nn4otb7un5mwr6rsbc/app.bsky.feed.post/3myi4lg6mnx26", "author_did": "did:plc:wgqjs6nn4otb7un5mwr6rsbc", "handle": "lancedojogo.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-22T16:48:39Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T16:48:40.539Z", "text": "Bucks x Bulls hoje! \ud83c\udfc0 O Fiserv Forum vai tremer em busca da reabilita\u00e7\u00e3o na NBA. Quem leva a melhor?\n\nAssista no NBA League Pass! \ud83d\udcfa\n\nD\u00ea seu palpite nos coment\u00e1rios! \ud83d\udc47\n\n#NBA #Bucks #Bulls #Basquete #NBANoBrasil"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:m3fplcau4gtobxb3li5wgikd/app.bsky.feed.post/3myi2veheli26", "author_did": "did:plc:m3fplcau4gtobxb3li5wgikd", "handle": "realnba.com", "created_at": "2026-10-22T16:18:25Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T16:18:26.642Z", "text": "#NBA #Yahoo Milwaukee Bucks NBA 2K27 simulation: Part 1 https://w.st/sgxQj"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:tm7k52cskl64b5tplme5wy6l/app.bsky.feed.post/3myi25g5k4c2b", "author_did": "did:plc:tm7k52cskl64b5tplme5wy6l", "handle": "basquetplus.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-22T16:05:02.964Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T16:05:06.450Z", "text": "Anthony Davis igual\u00f3 el estreno con m\u00e1s puntos en la historia de la franquicia. La Ceja adem\u00e1s aport\u00f3 12 rebotes en el triunfo ante Milwaukee Bucks, 128-116.\n\nDavis fue aterrador en su debut con Washington: mir\u00e1 los 34 puntos de la ceja\nVIDEO: basquetplus.com/nba-anthony-..."}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-22T17:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-22T18:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:dbmfm5546xoae5pfalkxlmea/app.bsky.feed.post/3myibr7y7b22j", "author_did": "did:plc:dbmfm5546xoae5pfalkxlmea", "handle": "moxon-will.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-22T18:21:23.785Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T18:21:26.352Z", "text": "Yeahhhhhh the Bucks signing Gary Trent Jr. to a 4-year, $64m deal for a DNP in the season opener is a real slap in the face #FearTheDeer \nbehindthebuckpass.com/gary-trent-j..."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:g447wbzly267ltp3ptv3z6pd/app.bsky.feed.post/3myiayxw2vu2v", "author_did": "did:plc:g447wbzly267ltp3ptv3z6pd", "handle": "madison.com", "created_at": "2026-10-22T18:07:48.846Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T18:07:51.037Z", "text": "Anthony Davis scored 34 points and grabbed 12 rebounds to lead the Washington Wizards to a 128-116 victory over the visiting Milwaukee Bucks in the teams' season opener Wednesday night"}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-22T19:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:bm3onnf4abdvrh7z75skiqhn/app.bsky.feed.post/3myifrgitq22c", "author_did": "did:plc:bm3onnf4abdvrh7z75skiqhn", "handle": "nbcsportsbayarea.com", "created_at": "2026-10-22T19:33:05.592Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T19:33:06.948Z", "text": "The Warriors reportedly reached out to the Bucks about a possible Kristaps Porzi\u0146\u0123is trade \ud83d\ude2c"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:fg63dp4zuulfilx6fkiesvnv/app.bsky.feed.post/3myielyh57b2v", "author_did": "did:plc:fg63dp4zuulfilx6fkiesvnv", "handle": "inforadaronline.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-22T19:12:09.231317+00:00", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T19:12:09.547Z", "text": "Bucks e Bulls se enfrentam hoje no Fiserv Forum! \ud83d\udd25\n\nAmbos buscam reabilita\u00e7\u00e3o ap\u00f3s derrotas. Quem leva a melhor? O favoritismo \u00e9 dos Bucks, mas o Chicago vem forte.\n\nAssista ao vivo pelo NBA League Pass:\n\n\n#NBA #Bucks #Bulls #Basquete #NBANoBrasil"}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-22T20:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": []}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-22T21:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:ndiridku6fjpliymq4pi3ag5/app.bsky.feed.post/3myinnnnicq2k", "author_did": "did:plc:ndiridku6fjpliymq4pi3ag5", "handle": "kill-bait.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:54:08.101637700Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-22T21:54:09.039Z", "text": "State Department official ejected from NBA game after drink-throwing incident with fan\n\n\ud83e\udd16 IA: It's not clickbait \u2705\n\ud83d\udc65 Users: It's not clickbait \u2705\n\n#nba #statedepartment \n\n\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47\ud83d\udc47"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:vmr6zg2ppatrwdt6utzjqjmb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myjrzl2lq2m2", "author_did": "did:plc:vmr6zg2ppatrwdt6utzjqjmb", "handle": "thecomeback.com.web.brid.gy", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:32:02.000Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-23T08:45:09.042Z", "text": ""}]}, {"team": "mil", "query": "\"Milwaukee Bucks\"", "hour": "2026-10-22T22:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:5bpq2qyomzyrcl5fvlt7okpq/app.bsky.feed.post/3myiptbskr22m",